  description: 'During damage calculation, if a monster battles while a monster with
    1000 or more ATK is on the field: The ATK of all monsters currently on the field
    becomes reduced by 1000 for every 1000 ATK they have, also their DEF becomes
    reduced by 1000 for every 1000 DEF they have. If this card is destroyed: Apply
    the above ATK/DEF adjustments to all monsters currently on the field, until the
    end of this turn.'
